{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to summon cloud companions to fight monster waves can try the Cloud Keeper demo!<br>This demo contains the following content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 characters to unlock and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 cloud companion types to summon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 shrine visitors to befriend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 boss</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/cdea9520ba9904fef61d2b3f391e6d64.poster.avif?t=1757545465\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/cdea9520ba9904fef61d2b3f391e6d64.webm?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/cdea9520ba9904fef61d2b3f391e6d64.mp4?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land inspired by Korean folklore, summon cloud companions and fight the hordes of monsters. Collect coins and make offerings in exchange for more clouds and relics to upgrade your cloud army. Fulfill your duty as Cloud Keeper to the moon goddess Dal and stop the spread of destruction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play and unlock multiple unique characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple characters to play as the Cloud Keeper, each with different abilities to make every run a unique challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/c6a90e85e0ea02b30a6de47f74a17b3a.poster.avif?t=1757545465\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/c6a90e85e0ea02b30a6de47f74a17b3a.webm?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/c6a90e85e0ea02b30a6de47f74a17b3a.mp4?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon clouds and collect relics to make them stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and build an army of clouds to fight for you! Fuse 3 clouds of the same type into a stronger form! Make offerings in exchange for relics to upgrade your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/2a1f884e6be8e9a122f279b81c42332d.poster.avif?t=1757545465\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/2a1f884e6be8e9a122f279b81c42332d.webm?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/2a1f884e6be8e9a122f279b81c42332d.mp4?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend shrine visitors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover intriguing visitors in the shrine and give them gifts to become friends! They may give unique relics in return!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/582e98dec0f5d172ec6b0b5e7a5bc35a.poster.avif?t=1757545465\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/582e98dec0f5d172ec6b0b5e7a5bc35a.webm?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/582e98dec0f5d172ec6b0b5e7a5bc35a.mp4?t=1757545465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793880?t=1757545465","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/f4ee6476f50f01f20f40bacb62e4bb8cdce56382/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757545465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/802a9a2411d286a9d73cbedc9399ee44cb0d6a6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757545465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/802a9a2411d286a9d73cbedc9399ee44cb0d6a6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757545465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to summon cloud companions to fight monster waves can try the Cloud Keeper demo!<br>This demo contains the following content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 characters to unlock and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 cloud companion types to summon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 shrine visitors to befriend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 boss</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793880/extras/cdea9520ba9904